Crossed module [..->..] :- 
: Source algebra has generators:
  [ (Z(2)^0)*()+(Z(2)^0)*(4,5), (Z(2)^0)*(1,2,3)+(Z(2)^0)*(1,2,3)(4,5), 
  (Z(2)^0)*(1,3,2)+(Z(2)^0)*(1,3,2)(4,5) ]
: Range algebra has generators:
  [ (Z(2)^0)*(), (Z(2)^0)*(1,2,3) ]
: Boundary homomorphism maps source generators to:
  [ <zero> of ..., <zero> of ..., <zero> of ... ]

